{%- comment -%}
  ELOURA - Cookie Policy Template
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="eloura-page-wrapper">
  <div class="container eloura-legal-container">
    <div class="eloura-page-header">
      <span class="eloura-page-eyebrow">BROWSER &amp; PRIVACY</span>
      <h1 class="eloura-page-title">COOKIE POLICY</h1>
      <p class="eloura-page-subtitle">Last updated: {{ 'now' | date: '%B %d, %Y' }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="eloura-article-content">
      <h2>1. WHAT ARE COOKIES?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files that are stored on your computer or mobile device when you browse websites. They help the website remember your shopping cart items, preferences, and browsing actions over time.</p>

      <h2>2. HOW ELOURA USES COOKIES</h2>
      <p>We use cookies to maintain your shopping cart session, remember your regional currency preferences, analyze website traffic patterns, and optimize site loading speed.</p>

      <h2>3. ESSENTIAL COOKIES</h2>
      <p>These cookies are strictly necessary to enable core site functionality such as shopping bag storage, secure checkout, and customer account access.</p>

      <h2>4. MANAGING YOUR PREFERENCES</h2>
      <p>You can choose to disable or block cookies through your individual browser settings at any time. Please note that disabling essential cookies may impact certain store features, such as adding garments to your shopping bag.</p>

      <h2>5. INQUIRIES</h2>
      <p>For inquiries regarding our use of cookies, contact us at <strong>Eloura.pk1@gmail.com</strong>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cookie Policy",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}

